  300+0000              ;the following need passive mode:
  301+0000              ;	RETR		download file
  302+0000              ;	STOR		upload file
  303+0000              ;	STOU		like STOR, but a new file is set
  304+0000              ;	LIST		download directory list
  305+0000              ;	NLST argument	list of directory "argument" and file names (without attributes)
  306+0000
  307+0000              ;the following do not need passive mode:
  308+0000              ;	MKD argument	make new directory called "argument"
  309+0000              ;	RMD argument	remove directory called "argument"
  310+0000              ;	RNFR+RNTO	rename file
  311+0000              ;	SIZE		find out file length
  312+0000              ;	QUIT		quits ftp connection
  313+0000              ;	PWD		returns current directory name
  314+0000              ;	CWD argument	go to directory "argument"
  315+0000              ;	CDUP		go to up directory
  316+0000              ;	DELE argument	delete file "argument"
  317+0000
  318+0000              ;overview:
  319+0000              ;LOW LEVEL- SENDING
  320+0000              ;1) send_string:	mainly to send direct AT commands
  321+0000              ;2) send_data:		to send any type of data
  322+0000              ;LOW LEVEL- RECEIVING
  323+0000              ;7) receive_data_timeout receive data with timeout.IN=BC=max.length of data to receive, HL=sata start, OUT Z= ok, received
  324+0000              ;LOW LEVEL- PARSING
  325+0000              ;10) look_for_string:	seeks certain string in memory
  326+0000              ;11) look_on_fly:	seeks certain string in the incoming flow of bytes
  327+0000              ;12) search_by_Busy	seeks string in memory, according to Busy (in BSDOS)
  328+0000              ;13) search_until_zero
