 7661+7E19              ;63) prints error message, IN=register C=error number, OUT=print output, then returns to the main program
 7662+7E19              ;may be called at any time from any place
 7663+7E19              ;if "error_handler" called, it jumps to the highest level, if "display_error" is called, it returns,
 7664+7E19              ;to from where it has been called
 7665+7E19              ;3 types:
 7666+7E19              ;display_error=		only displays error number from C input an returns with carry
 7667+7E19              ;error_handler=		displays error and jumps to error_handler_loop
 7668+7E19              ;error_handler1=	only jumps to error handler loop
