   21+A0ED              ; Baud discovery cannot use the fatal normal UART timeout. Each read has a
   22+A0ED              ; short polling budget; the complete probe is bounded too. Only standalone OK
   23+A0ED              ; is accepted. Echo and boot notices are skipped; IPD is never searched as text.
   24+A0ED              at_probe_byte
